{
  "version": "v3-3model",
  "description": "Model B = weighted ensemble ViT-B/16-384 v3 + EfficientNet-B4-448 v3 + EfficientNet-B4-448 two-head (Phase E). v2 (ResNet-50 + ViT-B/16 256) removed.",
